cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or software, please cite it as below. Data is licensed CC BY 4.0 — attribute OpenVan.camp."
title: "OpenVan.camp Public API: open vanlife and RV travel data"
abstract: >-
  Free, no-auth REST API, MCP server and JavaScript SDK with open travel data for vanlife and RV
  travelers: whole-trip roadbooks, retail fuel prices for 160+ countries, toll roads, public and school
  holidays, travel hazards, power plugs, customs rules, visa and temporary vehicle-import rules,
  weather suitability scores for countries and cities, food cost index, license plates of the world, currency rates,
  vanlife events and multilingual news.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenVan.camp"
    website: "https://openvan.camp"
    email: "hello@openvan.camp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/openvancamp/openvan-camp-public-api"
url: "https://openvan.camp/en/developers"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - vanlife
  - rv
  - campervan
  - fuel prices
  - visa rules
  - license plates
  - toll roads
  - holidays
  - customs rules
  - open data
  - mcp server
  - travel api
